// What a module's 'extends' refuses as it is parsed: more than one module, a
// path, and no name at all.
//
// Parse stage. Each is a declaration a submodule's designated file writes, since
// a module declares itself once and each needs a module of its own.
//
// The folder holds:
//   pair/pair.cone       extends two modules
//   dotted/dotted.cone   extends a path
//   bare/bare.cone       extends nothing it names
